## How to write PRDs
- Use the template in @prd-template.md  
- User stories in INVEST format  
- Acceptance criteria as Given/When/Then  
- Success metrics with numeric targets  
- Flag uncertainty as [OPEN QUESTION] - never invent data  

## Quality bar
- Every recommendation answers "so what?"  
- No filler language, no AI-sounding phrases  
- Direct, evidence-based, no hedging  

## What NOT to do
- Do not invent metrics or data  
- Do not use generic frameworks our team doesn't follow  
- Do not produce anything you wouldn't show the CPO
